Epykit uses the region-only correction and legacy CpG engine. BB remains experimental. New R calls use the recorded statistical settings and all twelve samples with no benchmark memory or time cap. The models omit donor pairing. Paper agreement is descriptive, not biological precision or FDR. Matches use direction-concordant, 1-based inclusive hg19 intervals at any, 50%, and 80% reciprocal base-pair overlap. Four-call-set historical comparisons are retained as separate source runs. Failed calls are excluded and recorded in the run manifest.

